{"id":"88a9a11cf6ba5c17","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-inductive.md","title":"归约归纳性","display":"df-inductive — 归约归纳性","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-inductive","aliases":["56-df-inductive"],"display":"df-inductive — 归约归纳性","depends_on":["[[56-df-relation-closure]]","[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]"],"source_section":"§1.1 Definition 1.1.15(i)","source_printed_pages":"13","source_ocr_blocks":[34],"source_verification":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-inductive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-inductive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inductive — 归约归纳性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.1 Definition 1.1.15(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"13"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>34</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>；单关系ARS见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89129816153530db\" href=\"?note=89129816153530db\" title=\"56-df-abstract-reduction-system\">56-df-abstract-reduction-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to^*\">\\(\\to^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inductive}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall f\\in A^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\left((\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(n)\\to f(n+1))\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists b\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(n)\\to^*b\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Inductive}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall f\\in A^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\left((\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(n)\\to f(n+1))\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists b\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(n)\\to^*b\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书量化有限或无限归约序列。任何有限序列都以末项为共同后继，故公式仅写可能有实质限制的无限序列，精确等价于原书性质。Inductive不表示对某个谓词实施归纳证明。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\to\\sub